From 4fa28ceeca28264dc97ddec45acabf17fc851359 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus V2 Builder <builder@lotus.org>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:58:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] perf(v2): cache CTransaction serialize size, defer
 removeForBlock overlay walks, and optimize ConnectTip/Snapshot hotpaths

Cache serialized byte size on CTransaction, batch Merklix overlay removals
during removeForBlock, and eliminate redundant copies in ConnectTip and
SnapshotPublisher.
